/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   YOLO REAL-TIME 3D NEURAL NETWORK & FINAL OBJECT DETECTION VISUALIZER
   ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   1. Input Layer: Receives the raw input image batch.
   2. Convolution (Conv): Extracts visual features.
   3. Batch Normalization (BN): Normalizes activations to stabilize training.
   4. Activation (SiLU): Adds non-linearity.
   5. C2f / C3 / C3k2: Extracts and combines features efficiently.
   6. SPPF: Captures multi-scale spatial information.
   7. Upsample: Increases feature-map resolution.
   8. Concat: Combines feature maps from different layers.
   9. Detect Head: Decoupled regression & classification anchor logits.
   10. Final Result: Real output image with classifying & final object detection labels!
   ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

